Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix:=20Honeywell=20relay=20key=20collision=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20split=20plant/cyber/supplier=20into=20distinct=20do?=
 =?UTF-8?q?mains?=
